+/* ---- AudioReach playback graph ------------------------------------------
+ * Copied verbatim from the vendor HAL's own graph table (the AGM service
+ * keeps 1718 of them in memory; see docs/10).  This one is the smallest
+ * playback graph: subgraph 0xb000013d, container 0xe00001b8,
+ * SAL(0x07001010, iid 0x483f) -> CODEC_DMA_SINK(0x07001023, iid 0x4840),
+ * one connection 0x483f:1 -> 0x4840:2.
+ *
+ * The table in the AGM service is serialised for storage (12-byte param
+ * header); the wire format needs the 16-byte apm_module_param_data with
+ * error_code and 8-byte aligned sections, so the sections are rebuilt
+ * here from the same fields.
